   "inputs": [],
   "outputs": [],
   "widgets_values": [
    "# 01e · Qwen-Image-Edit 2511 — put your persona into a new shot\n**Use:** load the reference (hero face, `claude-tools\\persona\\maren\\hero.png`) → write the **instruction** → Run →\n`H3test/qwen_edit_*.png`. ≈ 3.7 min per 1 MP image (40 steps, cfg 4 = template quality branch).\n\n| Field | Meaning |\n|---|---|\n| instruction | start with the identity line (name the marks!), then the NEW shot: framing, place, outfit, light, expression |\n| camera-angles LoRA | fal Multiple-Angles: prompt `<sks> front-left quarter view eye-level shot medium shot` (azimuth · elevation · distance) |\n| steps / cfg | 40 / 4 quality · the Lightning 4-step LoRA is not installed |\n\n**Series 3 rules:** name every permanent mark in every edit or it is dropped · never mention clothes the reference doesn't\nwear · for the side without the marks say \"her left cheek with the mole is turned away and not visible\", otherwise the head\nalways turns to the mark side · \"close-up\" with the angles LoRA crops to macro — use \"medium shot\" · identity is best with\nmedium/close faces (ArcFace 0.55–0.67), weak when the face is < 100 px."
   ]
  },
